Cell["\<\
Each path segment is {{k1,k2},{label1,label2}} in reciprocal fractional \
coordinates. MagneticTB samples npoint intervals per segment and evaluates \
the Bloch variables at 2 Pi k.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"952e4ebc-5c0a-4e4a-9892-28142a48d717"],

Cell["\<\
The result is a framed Graphics object. Automatic path selection requires a \
current model prepared by init or initfromrep.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"a588023f-6771-4a9e-b2ad-2bf0f4da09ae"],

Cell["\<\
bandplot returns $Failed and issues a message when the path, sample count, \
parameter rules, vertical ticks, or font settings are invalid. It does not \
repair the input or switch to an approximate fallback.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"1f1c5d05-7044-40a3-a5ac-f434766902c9"],

